    <node id="Legal Dataset">
      <data key="d0">Legal Dataset</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The Legal dataset is a large collection of legal documents used for testing retrieval systems, showing a performance gap with LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legal Dataset is the subject of cost and adaptability analysis, comparing the performance of GraphRAG and LightRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legal Dataset is used for evaluating model performance in terms of cost and adaptability in retrieval-augmented generation systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legal dataset is the largest, comprising 94 documents with a total of 5,081,069 tokens for comparative analysis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4bab87c8efa9d31a96dc87b4b47d588a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20fbc060c512f64ca1f33b81ac188d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2de5b5a3feb99940c91501c27ba9f343&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dc9263f77a3b5d565a77a808d2de587</data>
