      <data key="d0">F1 Score</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">F1 Score is a metric used in evaluating machine learning models that combines precision and recall to measure accuracy.&lt;SEP&gt;The F1 score is a performance metric that evaluates the balance between precision and recall for a machine learning model.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4bab87c8efa9d31a96dc87b4b47d588a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f188543fb58390e379ea6d2f1dc2ef58</data>
