    <node id="Toolformer">
      <data key="d0">Toolformer</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Toolformer is an advanced model that uses retrieval techniques in its operations to enhance information sourcing.&lt;SEP&gt;Toolformer describes a framework where language models learn to use tools autonomously, as highlighted in recent research findings.</data>
