    <node id="Empowerment">
      <data key="d0">Empowerment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Empowerment is another metric evaluated in the performance of TagRAG regarding its methods across datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;Empowerment assesses the effectiveness of TagRAG in providing meaningful and impactful results in knowledge graph scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Empowerment describes the ability of readers to make informed decisions about feature selection based on the information provided.&lt;SEP&gt;Empowerment indicates how effectively an answer aids the reader in making informed judgments about a topic.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fca82b44b4c7fd0632ad9bf69000d74e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d7629e55627c5114e5c8553304cfaf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0153506fe6cfb54fe11a5557e1a5a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aec7f8f39f2b2b14e58a248d55aa8ff6</data>
