      <data key="d0">Answer 2</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Answer 2 provides a more direct but less comprehensive overview compared to Answer 1, focusing mainly on feature selection techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Answer 2 is the second response evaluated alongside Answer 1 based on the same criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fca82b44b4c7fd0632ad9bf69000d74e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d996179ca03cd750046549600e440a2</data>
