      <data key="d0">Keyword Extraction</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Keyword Extraction describes a process for distinguishing between high-level and low-level keywords from a user’s query.&lt;SEP&gt;Keyword Extraction is the process of identifying significant keywords from a text document.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fca82b44b4c7fd0632ad9bf69000d74e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4dab3d7bf1cd6f56a1ccda1dd029330</data>
