      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Chao Huang is a researcher involved in the LightRAG project at the University of Hong Kong.&lt;SEP&gt;Chao Huang is a corresponding author mentioned in relation to the RAG systems and their methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Chao Huang is a co-author of the paper "Graphgpt: Graph instruction tuning for large language models" presented at SIGIR in 2024.</data>
