      <data key="d0">Agriculture Dataset</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The Agriculture dataset is one of the datasets analyzed to assess the performance of retrieval-augmented generation systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agriculture dataset consists of 12 documents totaling 2,017,886 tokens and serves as part of the analysis.</data>
