      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The CS dataset relates to computer science documents and is used for evaluating retrieval-augmented generation systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The CS dataset is composed of 10 documents that amount to 2,306,535 tokens, used in the experimental evaluations.</data>
