      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mix dataset includes 61 documents with a total of 619,009 tokens, contributing to the overall data evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Mix dataset is utilized for verifying comparative methods in knowledge graph construction, providing a basis for incremental analysis.</data>
