    <node id="DTR">
      <data key="d0">DTR</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">DTR refers to Document Tracking and Retrieval, a core module within the BDTR framework that improves the likelihood of covering important documents.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2c698ed84457a758cb717d3a15350b23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db856360bc385f7452666f475b3048d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cda1598277a8b2328ba59179c044b1e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
