    <node id="Dual-Level Retrieval Paradigm">
      <data key="d0">Dual-Level Retrieval Paradigm</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dual-Level Retrieval Paradigm is a strategy proposed by LightRAG for generating query keys at both detailed and abstract levels to effectively retrieve information.&lt;SEP&gt;The dual-level retrieval paradigm used by LightRAG integrates both low-level and high-level information retrieval for enhanced performance.</data>
