    <node id="Structured Databases">
      <data key="d0">Structured Databases</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Structured databases are systems that require additional effort to build, validate, and maintain, particularly in the context of optimization and retrieval tasks.</data>
