      <data key="d2">Newman Cheng is a member of the research team working on the analysis of the GraphRAG framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Newman Cheng is mentioned as an author in research related to a graph-based retrieval-augmented generation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7678e9a46c89cdf3fec615dd964aa658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbe13b92a1c768e1d7f7a8b32dd7be5d</data>
