    <node id="PathRAG">
      <data key="d0">PathRAG</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">PathRAG is a framework developed by Chen et al. in 2025 that extracts key relational paths and converts them into text prompts for coherent generation.&lt;SEP&gt;PathRAG is a retrieval-augmented generation method that prunes graph-based structures with relational paths.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7678e9a46c89cdf3fec615dd964aa658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-914f521409f287f2603dab0bba5c0f95</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
