    <node id="Electric Vehicles">
      <data key="d0">Electric Vehicles</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Electric vehicles are vehicles that are powered by electricity, whose influence on urban air quality and infrastructure is studied in relation to public transportation.</data>
