      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Graph structures are tools for modeling interdependencies among entities, enhancing understanding and information retrieval capabilities in complex systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph structures are frameworks utilized for knowledge representation, capturing complex relationships in data during retrieval.</data>
