    <node id="RAG-Fusion">
      <data key="d0">RAG-Fusion</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">RAG-Fusion utilizes a multi-query strategy to enhance traditional search processes by expanding queries and utilizing parallel vector searches.&lt;SEP&gt;RAG-Fusion is a concept discussed by A. H. Raudaschl in relation to future advancements in retrieval-augmented generation methodologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-50fab934716e3d9351f065107bc18294&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cb0fa3c7f17705ec4d14e2eea4192a2</data>
