    <node id="LlamaIndex">
      <data key="d0">LlamaIndex</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">LlamaIndex is a framework associated with implementing post-retrieval strategies to enhance the relevance of retrieved information.&lt;SEP&gt;LlamaIndex is a platform discussed in the context of evaluating chunk sizes for retrieval-augmented generation systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-84e65b4bb00eb8e1046ad99348354b03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b88e564c6e5481a9f0d34cd7ae3cc0e</data>
