    <node id="GPT-4o-mini">
      <data key="d0">GPT-4o-mini</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">GPT-4o-mini is a model used for LLM-based operations in LightRAG and GraphRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;GPT-4o-mini is a large language model used during the implementation for generating questions and processing data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-da2807be669ed8cdf9e947355ab6a13d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ebd52158a59e9e9abf2431acd03979e</data>
