    <edge source="LightRAG" target="TagRAG">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">TagRAG aims to build efficient knowledge graphs and improves upon methods like LightRAG for knowledge accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is compared against LightRAG to evaluate its performance in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG shows better performance efficiency compared to LightRAG, which has lower performance due to semantic issues.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is compared to LightRAG to analyze their effectiveness in question answering tasks.</data>
      <data key="d9">efficiency,evaluation metric,knowledge graph development,method comparison,method evaluation,performance comparison,performance validation</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-ac038b8f5f47fa541303b546a0df1bf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d7629e55627c5114e5c8553304cfaf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ef51634d2a912725971ad5d52c5142d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-914f521409f287f2603dab0bba5c0f95</data>
