      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="LightRAG" target="GraphRAG">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">LightRAG is evaluated against GraphRAG to analyze its strengths in question generation.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG consistently outperforms GraphRAG in various evaluative scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG is compared to GraphRAG to assess improvements in various evaluation metrics for machine learning.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG enhances efficiency compared to GraphRAG by reducing token costs and adapting quicker to new data.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG simplifies the knowledge graph structure within the context of GraphRAG.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG improves on GraphRAG by integrating lightweight graphs for more efficient knowledge access.&lt;SEP&gt;GraphRAG is evaluated against LightRAG to assess different approaches in retrieval-augmented generation.</data>
      <data key="d9">comparison,efficiency,efficiency improvement,method comparison,method improvement,method superiority,model comparison,performance comparison,performance evaluation,structural simplification</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-4bab87c8efa9d31a96dc87b4b47d588a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2de5b5a3feb99940c91501c27ba9f343&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da2807be669ed8cdf9e947355ab6a13d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a666055a236002fef9bb78a46449b7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dc9263f77a3b5d565a77a808d2de587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-914f521409f287f2603dab0bba5c0f95&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ebd52158a59e9e9abf2431acd03979e</data>
