    <edge source="LightRAG" target="Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">LightRAG enhances Retrieval-Augmented Generation systems by integrating graph structures.&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG serves as an enhancement to the RAG framework by combining multiple retrieval strategies for improved outputs.</data>
