    <edge source="LightRAG" target="Retrieval-Augmented Generation">
      <data key="d7">3.0</data>
      <data key="d8">LightRAG integrates graph structures to improve the Retrieval-Augmented Generation framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Retrieval-Augmented Generation is integrated into the LightRAG framework to optimize data retrieval and response generation.&lt;SEP&gt;The LightRAG framework is a specific implementation of the principles underlying Retrieval-Augmented Generation methodologies.</data>
