    <edge source="TagRAG" target="GraphRAG">
      <data key="d7">7.0</data>
      <data key="d8">TagRAG serves as an improvement over GraphRAG by enhancing global knowledge representation and reasoning.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is highlighted as being more efficient compared to GraphRAG due to its incremental insertion mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is compared against GraphRAG to evaluate its performance in the experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG performs better than GraphRAG despite GraphRAG covering all communities, highlighting TagRAG's advantages.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG and GraphRAG are compared to analyze their performances across varied datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is compared to GraphRAG in terms of efficiency in knowledge integration.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is compared with GraphRAG in evaluating performance for question answering.</data>
      <data key="d9">efficiency,efficiency comparison,evaluation metric,framework development,knowledge improvement,method comparison,method differentiation,method evaluation,performance comparison,performance evaluation,performance validation</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-ac038b8f5f47fa541303b546a0df1bf9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d7629e55627c5114e5c8553304cfaf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7678e9a46c89cdf3fec615dd964aa658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ef51634d2a912725971ad5d52c5142d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b615900891f95591862c531adedc9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a666055a236002fef9bb78a46449b7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ebd52158a59e9e9abf2431acd03979e</data>
