      <data key="d13" />
    </edge>
    <edge source="TagRAG" target="MiniRAG">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">TagRAG is evaluated against MiniRAG to assess its dominance in performance metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG exhibits stronger performance than MiniRAG, though MiniRAG has good results.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is compared to MiniRAG to assess their performances in various scenarios, especially with smaller language models.&lt;SEP&gt;TagRAG is assessed against MiniRAG for performance evaluation.</data>
