    <edge source="Feature Selection Techniques" target="Filter Methods">
      <data key="d7">4.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Filter methods are classified as one of the types of feature selection techniques used to evaluate feature relevance.&lt;SEP&gt;Filter methods are one of the three main categories of feature selection techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Filter Methods are categorized under Feature Selection Techniques as a type of approach for selecting relevant features.&lt;SEP&gt;Filter methods are one category of feature selection techniques used for evaluating feature relevance.</data>
